  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political Economy Analysis (PEA) of the Horticulture Sector in Southwest Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Political Economy Analysis (PEA) process is to provide a better understanding of the power relations, political actors&apos; behavior, dynamics, structures, and processes that affect the horticulture sector in Southwestern Nigeria. Also, to provide clear handles and paths for future intervention by mapping opportunities to strengthen the local private sector while simultaneously identifying business opportunities for Dutch horticulture sector players.It will also serve as the foundation for the ongoing South West Horticulture Roadmap as part of the combi-track &quot;Horticulture&quot; of the Netherlands embassy in Abuja, Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
